  {
    "id": "bhagavad-gita_12_1",
    "text_slug": "bhagavad-gita",
    "chapter": 12,
    "verse": 1,
    "original": "अर्जुन उवाच |\nएवं सततयुक्ता ये भक्तास्त्वां पर्युपासते |\nये चाप्यक्षरमव्यक्तं तेषां के योगवित्तमाः ||१२-१||",
    "transliteration": "arjuna uvāca .\nevaṃ satatayuktā ye bhaktāstvāṃ paryupāsate .\nye cāpyakṣaramavyaktaṃ teṣāṃ ke yogavittamāḥ ||12-1||",
    "meaning": "12.1 Arjuna said  Those devotees who, ever steadfast, thus worship Thee and those also who worship the imperishable and the unmanifested  which of them are better versed in Yoga?",
